1	/**
2	 * `nexus worktree merge` and `prune` (WP-1312).
3	 *
4	 * merge: commit what is dirty, squash, rebase onto the target, fast-forward only, then remove the worktree and its
5	 * branch. Nothing here runs a hook or an external command (commit messages are deterministic unless `--message` is
6	 * given). The pre-merge hook (WP-1313) will attach at `mergeSeams.preMerge` below, after every refusal.
7	 */
